{"id":2403,"unit_id":24,"title":"Talk to a Doctor Clearly","description":"Understand and use simple symptom and appointment language.","lesson_type":"practice","order_in_unit":2,"duration_min":12,"is_review":false,"exercises":[{"id":24025,"lesson_id":2403,"type":"teaching","prompt":"Use clear symptom chunks","data":{"type":"teaching","style":"list","heading":"Say what, since when, and ask again","body":"Keep your description simple. A doctor decides what it means.","items":[{"cz":"Bolí mě hlava.","en":"My head hurts."},{"cz":"Je mi špatně od včerejška.","en":"I have felt unwell since yesterday."},{"cz":"Mám teplotu dva dny.","en":"I have had a temperature for two days."},{"cz":"Můžete to prosím zopakovat?","en":"Could you repeat that, please?"}]},"answer_key":"health chunks","xp_reward":0},{"id":24026,"lesson_id":2403,"type":"listening_comprehension","prompt":"Listen to the appointment call","data":{"type":"listening_comprehension","prompt_en":"What symptom and duration does the caller give?","transcript_cz":"Dobrý den, bolí mě v krku a mám teplotu od včerejška. Můžu se objednat k lékaři?","questions":[{"question_en":"What hurts?","options":["The throat","The leg","The eye"],"correct_index":0},{"question_en":"Since when?","options":["Since yesterday","For a month","Since morning only"],"correct_index":0}]},"answer_key":"throat; yesterday","xp_reward":15},{"id":24027,"lesson_id":2403,"type":"reading_comprehension","prompt":"Read the clinic message","data":{"type":"reading_comprehension","prompt_en":"Find the appointment time and what to bring.","image":"assets/images/unit24/doctor_visit_v1.png","image_label":"A calm routine doctor conversation","text_cz":"Dobrý den, objednání je možné zítra v deset. Přineste si kartu pojištěnce a seznam léků, které užíváte. Když se váš stav zhorší, zavolejte nám.","text_en":"Hello, an appointment is available tomorrow at ten. Bring your insurance card and a list of medicines you take. If your condition gets worse, call us.","question